</header>

<main id="top">
  <!-- HERO -->
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="wrap hero-in">
      <figure class="hero-photo">
        <div class="hero-photo-frame"><div data-parallax class="hero-photo-img parallax-img"><video class="hero-video" src="/hero.mp4" poster="data:image/jpeg;base64," autoplay muted playsinline preload="auto" aria-label="Sodam favorites — poke bowl, onigiri, onigirazu and mango boba"></video>
        </div></div>
        <figcaption>The Sodam favorites — signature poke, triangular onigiri rice ball, karaage onigirazu &amp; mango boba</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <div>
        <h1><span class="hero-line hero-line-1">Fresh poke.</span><span class="hero-line hero-line-2">Warm rice.</span><span class="hero-line hero-line-3"><em>Made like family.</em></span></h1>
        <p class="lede">A small family-owned cafe on Hawthorne Boulevard in Torrance, serving generous poke bowls, Okinawa-style onigiri, handheld onigirazu, and boba drinks worth slowing down for.</p>
        <div class="hero-ctas">
          <a class="btn btn-solid" href="#menu">Order Pickup — Pay at the Cafe</a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="#menu">See the Menu</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-meta">
          <span class="openline"><span class="status-dot" id="statusDot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span id="statusText">Opens today 11:00 AM – 6:30 PM</span></span>
          <span><strong>Find us:</strong> 23211 Hawthorne Blvd, Suite 100, Torrance, CA 90505<br /><strong>Call:</strong> <a href="tel:+12132473453">(213) 247-3453</a></span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

